# #144 special cues: every Lich King special form shows its Warcraft spell.
# Lich King a against Lich King b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero lich king
# #144: Harvest Soul.
40 a stick 0 -1
40 a tap X 2
41 a stick 0 0
42 a capture
60 a capture
# Death Grip, his neutral special since 1 Nov.
120 a tap X 2
122 a capture
134 a capture
# Howling Gale, then from the air once its 120-frame cooldown has passed.
200 a stick 1 0
200 a tap X 2
201 a stick 0 0
214 a capture
222 a capture
320 a tap B 8
330 a stick 1 0
330 a tap X 2
331 a stick 0 0
344 a capture
350 a capture
# Death Grip from the air.
390 a tap B 8
400 a tap X 2
402 a capture
414 a capture
# #144: the up special after the prior casts.
460 a stick 0 1
460 a tap X 2
461 a stick 0 0
462 a capture
468 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# #144: the up special from the air (it has no air form).
640 a tap B 8
650 a stick 0 1
650 a tap X 2
651 a stick 0 0
652 a capture
658 a capture
# #144: the up special again.
800 a stick 0 1
800 a tap X 2
801 a stick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): every special form starts on its frame.
#! expect a 40 special 16 form 0
#! expect a 120 special 13 form 0
#! expect a 200 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 330 special 14 form 1
#! expect a 400 special 13 form 1
#! expect a 460 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 650 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 800 special 15 form 0
#! scene a DarkRitualCaster
#! scene a DeathCoilSpecialArt
#! scene a DeathCoilMissile
#! scene a TornadoElementalSmall
#! scene a FrostWyrm
802 a capture
808 a capture
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
